<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=mscorlib">
  <!-- ================================================================================
       CANONICAL 98SE. Synced from KillerShell's vendored copy 2026-08-11 - the canonical
       had drifted to 110 keys while KillerShell's was 212, which is why KillerScan's 98SE
       port kept failing token by token. KillerShell's is the reference and a strict
       superset, so this is that content. A few keys here are editor/tab/dual-pane specific
       (Syn_*, Tab*, EditorSelection*) and only KillerShell uses them; harmless extras for
       any other app. Do NOT let this drift again: update the master when you update an app.
       ================================================================================ -->
